@startuml
left to right direction
title Smart Campus Study Room Booking - Use Cases

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
  usecase "View availability" as UC1
  usecase "Book room" as UC2
  usecase "Cancel booking" as UC3
  usecase "Block or unblock room" as UC4
  usecase "Review usage" as UC5
  usecase "Send booking confirmation" as UC6
}

Student -- UC1
Student -- UC2
Student -- UC3
Administrator -- UC4
Administrator -- UC5

' why: R4 requires a confirmation after every successful booking
UC2 .> UC6 : <<include>>

' Assumptions:
' A1: Touching bookings are allowed; an end time equal to the next start time is not an overlap.
' A2: Blocking a room keeps existing bookings but prevents new bookings while the room is blocked.
@enduml
